y chosen as long as: Q3 and ratio Q3/Q1 are selected from paragraph 4.1 of OIML R49-1:2013(E); Q1 and Q2 are minimum values and ratio Q2/Q1 = 1.6; Q3 and Q4 are maximum values and ratio Q4/Q3 = 1.25; the ratio Q3/Q1 is at least 40.\",\n      \"footnotes\": [\"*\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recommendation\": {\n    \"id\": \"R49\",\n    \"edition\": 2013,\n    \"scheme\": \"A\",\n    \"accuracy_classes\": [1, 2]\n  },\n  \"test_reports\": [\n    {\"id\": \"NMi-13200198-01\", \"date\": \"2022-07-07\", \"pages\": 29, \"role\": \"test_report\"},\n    {\"id\": \"NMi-3531004-01\", \"date\": \"2023-07-04\", \"pages\": 20, \"role\": \"test_report\"},\n    {\"id\": \"NMi-3891220-01\", \"date\": \"2025-04-17\", \"pages\": 19, \"role\": \"test_report\"},\n    {\"id\": \"NMi-3891220-02\", \"date\": \"2025-07-31\", \"pages\": 18, \"role\": \"test_report\"},\n    {\"id\": \"NMi-3954718-01\", \"date\": \"2025-10-03\", \"pages\": 18, \"role\": \"test_report\"},\n    {\"id\": \"NMi-3954718-01R1\", \"date\": \"2025-10-03\", \"pages\": 19, \"role\": \"test_report\"},\n    {\"id\": \"NMi-3948757-01\", \"date\": \"2025-12-23\", \"pages\": 27, \"role\": \"test_report\"},\n    {\"id\": \"T10554-7\", \"role\": \"documentation_file\"}\n  ],\n  \"footnotes\": [\n    {\n      \"marker\": \"1\",\n      \"text\": \"This measuring instrument was previously placed on the market under the name \\\"Badger Meter Europe GmbH, Nürtinger Straße 76, 72639 Neuffen, Germany\\\"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"marker\": \"*\",\n      \"text\": \"For the reduced bore (RB) version, the size mentioned is the process connection size. On the inscriptions of the water meter the reduced bore meter will be identified as \\\"DNxxx RB\\\".\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
